 "code": "def max_profit(prices: list[int]) -> int:\n    best = 0\n    lowest = float(\"inf\")\n    for p in prices:\n        if p < lowest:\n            lowest = p\n        elif p - lowest > best:\n            best = p - lowest\n    return best\n",
